{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12203010","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12203010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1220301001:0":{"text":"그렉, 물자는 어떻게 됐어?!","source_cn":"格拉克，物资怎么样了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89FF953248E4BD94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1220301002:0":{"text":"아직 세고 있습니다, 부두목!","source_cn":"二当家，我还在数！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40C54655EF18B10C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220301003:0":{"text":"손가락이 부족하면 다른 사람 손이라도 빌려.","source_cn":"你自己的手指头要是不够掰，赶紧找边上的人再借一只手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB827AF660A0203BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220301004:0":{"text":"네! 발가락까지 빌렸어요!","source_cn":"是！脚趾头也借了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3761AA42A2E28AC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220301005:0":{"text":"꼼수 부릴 생각은 마. 쥐약 사러 간 녀석은 언제 오는 거야?","source_cn":"别耍聪明。买老鼠药的人什么时候回来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4918263A7A2DF37D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220301006:0":{"text":"부두목! 일이 방금 끝났어요... 바로 사러 갈게요!","source_cn":"二当家！我刚忙完……我马上去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB50BEBF25B592097","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220301007:0":{"text":"또 쥐 사료를 사 오면 그게 네놈 일 년 치 저녁밥이 될 줄 알아!","source_cn":"这回要是再买成老鼠饲料，那玩意就是你未来一年的晚餐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DFBAADDF0215661","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220301008:0":{"text":"이 굼뜬 신입 놈들이 언제쯤 소니아에게 도움이 될는지...","source_cn":"这些笨手笨脚的新人，什么时候才能给索尼娅分忧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D2DD262D9E1908E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220301009:0":{"text":"쥐 사료를 파는 곳을 찾은 것도 능력이에요, 루카.","source_cn":"能找到卖老鼠饲料的地方，也是一种本领啊，卢卡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E18931CF247BF4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220301010:1":{"text":"... 오 당신들?","source_cn":"……是你们？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAD57ED4660C1FC12","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"... 오 당신들?","female":"... 오 당신들?","variant_male_record_index":"133955","variant_female_record_index":"133956","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1220301010":{"text":"... 오 당신들?","source_cn":"……是你们？","status":